08032CD4 text-state-return

TextState_SetString copies r0 to r3 for the indexed write and returns via r1.
MessageWindow_SetStringArgument and ScrollingDialogue_SetStringArgument forward r0.

The explicit form changed the ROM bytes. The guarded form passed the unit ROM check.

--- a/src/fn/sub_08032CD4.c
+++ b/src/fn/sub_08032CD4.c
@@ -8,3 +8,6 @@
 {
     p->a[i] = v;
+#ifdef UBFIX
+    return (u32)p; // r0 retains the input state pointer on hardware
+#endif
 }
